  "94436-accept": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Danitha Morr",
   "npc": "246378",
   "questID": 94436,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "It's time to demonstrate your ability to channel one of the light's greatest gifts.\r\n\r\nThe item I just gave you is called the Symbol of Life. Take care, as it may cause you some discomfort to handle a talisman of the light such as this. The light may be anathema to the force that created us, but it is still our guide and ally. The pain reminds us of this.\r\n\r\nGo see Deathguard Billmuth downstairs. He just arrived and he has petitioned us for aid. Show him and the Forsaken what a true $c can do.",
   "time": 1791195121,
   "title": "A Lesson in Divinity",
   "wanted": true,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "94438-complete": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "complete",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Deathguard Falgan",
   "npc": "257663",
   "questID": 94438,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I'm... back? And saved by a $c no less? I see you carry a Symbol of Life. I've not seen one of those since... well, since before the war when Lordaeron was a very different place. I can only assume you are here to help. Billmuth and I were sent here to scout out the scarlet activity here, and we found out that they are planning some kind of attack.\r\n\r\nIf you would be willing to help more, there may yet be more that you can do to help the Forsaken.",
   "time": 1791229600,
   "title": "A Lesson in Divinity",
   "wanted": true,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "94440-accept": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Deathguard Falgan",
   "npc": "257663",
   "questID": 94440,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "These Scarlet Crusaders often carry satchels with their deployment orders. We know an attack is coming, but if we can recover their orders, we can warn the rest of the Deathguard and prepare an ambush. \r\n\r\nYou are clearly an impressive $c. Kill these scarlet animals and retrieve a copy of their orders and bring them back to Deathguard Billmuth. He'll take it from there.",
   "time": 1791229602,
   "title": "A Lesson in Divinity",
   "wanted": true,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "94440-progress": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Deathguard Billmuth",
   "npc": "257655",
   "questID": 94440,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
